menu "TinyAI Controller"

    config TINYAI_ENABLED
        bool "Compile the TinyAI intent classifier"
        default y
        help
            Builds the offline int8 linear intent model and lets natural-language
            commands use it. When disabled, all deterministic console GPIO
            commands, sensors, automation and the pin manager still work. AI is
            an optional interface, never part of the GPIO safety path.

    config TINYAI_AI_DEFAULT_ENABLED
        bool "Enable AI natural-language control at boot"
        depends on TINYAI_ENABLED
        default y
        help
            Runtime switch. Even when enabled, AI commands still require a
            configured device with ai_allowed=true and pass all policy checks.
            Use the console command "ai off" to disable at runtime.

endmenu
